      "content": "hey my 14yo daughter was just told she has anemia so she's been feeling really tired and pale all the time. i bought some iron supplements for her but the bottle says to take one a day. would it be okay if i gave her two of them every night to help her get better faster? she's about 110lbs so i feel like she could handle more.",
